</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Regulation of a periodic motor program in C. elegans</article-title><source>J. Neurosci.</source><year>1994</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>1953</fpage><lpage>1962</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8158250</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barstead</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kleiman</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Waterston</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cloning, sequencing, and mapping of an alpha-actinin gene from the nematode Caenorhabditis elegans</article-title><source>Cell Motil. Cytoskeleton</source><year>1991</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>69</fpage><lpage>78</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1756579</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Beanan</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Strome</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characterization of a germ-line proliferation mutation in C. elegans.</article-title><source>Development</source><year>1992</year><volume>116</volume><fpage>755</fpage><lpage>766</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1289064</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Larsson</surname><given-names>NG</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilhelmsson</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Oldfors</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Rustin</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Lewandoski</surname><given-names>M</g